        <item>
            <title>0.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:55:36 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://karui.jp/mac</link>
            <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Threads group exactly as on the iPhone: a group chat by its members, so a renamed group stays one thread, using the subtitle, sender, and recipients the iPhone now sends
- The same notification seen by both devices no longer appears twice when Spark fills in a subject line the iPhone leaves empty
- If Notification Center's database goes missing, as it can after the disk runs full, Karui says so instead of blaming Full Disk Access, and picks it up again on its own
- Return opens the selected notification or group, and ⌘[ goes back a level
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/littlebobert/karui-mac/releases/download/0.5.0/Karui-0.5.0-mac.zip" length="2122380" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="zMEkzZBcPJGf8ZphR3z4IUpTLeQMzzIbstcR2WJLKq8msaaVD92tLKAvWG29p9HRoQQHoOHFtKrN09CxtnvyCw=="/>
